    IF `the director contravenes subsection (3)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the subsection's own question; split site (i), fork F-215C-2): "Any director who contravenes subsection (3) shall be guilty of an offence" -- an element is unmet, so this subsection makes the director guilty of nothing on these facts

§ `Section 215D: short form amalgamation`

-- Heading (line 21249): "Short form amalgamation": not operative.

-- (1)(a): the two cases, by which company continues.
DECLARE `s 215D(1) which company continues` IS ONE OF
    `s 215D(1)(a)(i) the amalgamated holding company`
    `s 215D(1)(a)(ii) the amalgamated subsidiary company`

-- (1)(a): "in the case — (i) where the amalgamating companies continue as the amalgamated holding company — the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration; or
-- (ii) where the amalgamating companies continue as an amalgamated subsidiary company — the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company are to be issued and hold the same number of shares ... without any payment or other consideration
-- and the shares of each amalgamating company, except for the shares ... issued to the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company, will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration".
GIVEN continues IS A `s 215D(1) which company continues`
      `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company are to be issued and hold the same number of shares in the amalgamated subsidiary company as they hold in the amalgamating holding company without any payment or other consideration` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares of each amalgamating company, except for the shares issued to the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company, will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 215D(1)(a) the terms of paragraph (a) are in the resolution` MEANS
    CONSIDER continues
    WHEN `s 215D(1)(a)(i) the amalgamated holding company` THEN `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration`
    WHEN `s 215D(1)(a)(ii) the amalgamated subsidiary company` THEN (`the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company are to be issued and hold the same number of shares in the amalgamated subsidiary company as they hold in the amalgamating holding company without any payment or other consideration` AND `the shares of each amalgamating company, except for the shares issued to the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company, will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration`)

-- (1): "A company (called in this subsection the amalgamating holding company) and one or more of its wholly-owned subsidiaries ... may amalgamate and continue as one company, being the amalgamated holding company or the amalgamated subsidiary company,
-- without complying with sections 215B and 215C if the members of each amalgamating company, by special resolution at a general meeting, resolve to approve an amalgamation of the amalgamating companies on the terms that (a) ...; (b) ...; (c) ...; (d) ...".
-- A grant ("may") with an "if" gate: NOTHING when it fails (grant ruling of 2026-11-12, limit 1; fork F-215D-1).
