`s 215D(1) the amalgamating holding company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries may amalgamate without complying with sections 215B and 215C` MEANS
    IF    `the amalgamating companies are a company and one or more of its wholly-owned subsidiaries`
      AND `the members of each amalgamating company, by special resolution at a general meeting, resolved to approve an amalgamation of the amalgamating companies`
      AND `s 215D(1)(a) the terms of paragraph (a) are in the resolution` continues `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration` `the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company are to be issued and hold the same number of shares in the amalgamated subsidiary company as they hold in the amalgamating holding company without any payment or other consideration` `the shares of each amalgamating company, except for the shares issued to the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company, will be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration`
      AND `the constitution of the amalgamated company will be the same as the constitution of the amalgamating company whose shares are not cancelled`
      AND `the directors of the amalgamating holding company and every amalgamating subsidiary company are satisfied that the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due as at the date on which the amalgamation is to become effective`
      AND `the person or persons named as director or directors in the resolution of each amalgamating company will be the director or directors of the amalgamated company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "may amalgamate and continue as one company ... without complying with sections 215B and 215C if the members of each amalgamating company, by special resolution at a general meeting, resolve to approve an amalgamation of the amalgamating companies on the terms that" (a grant with an "if" gate; grant ruling of 2026-11-12, limit 1; fork F-215D-1)

