    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Every director who votes in favour of the making of the solvency statement mentioned in subsection (5) must sign a declaration" (a duty that arises only for the director who so votes; periods ruling (b), marginal reading (a))

-- src:21348 | (6) Every director who votes in favour of the making of the
-- src:21349 | solvency statement mentioned in subsection (5) must sign a
-- src:21350 | declaration stating —
-- src:21352 | (a) that, in the director’s opinion, the conditions specified in
-- src:21353 | section 215J(1)(a) and (b) are satisfied; and
-- src:21355 | (b) the grounds for that opinion.
@ref s 215D(6) content (src:21348-21355)
GIVEN `the declaration states that, in the director's opinion, the conditions specified in section 215J(1)(a) and (b) are satisfied` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the declaration states the grounds for that opinion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 215D(6) the declaration states what the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF `the declaration states that, in the director's opinion, the conditions specified in section 215J(1)(a) and (b) are satisfied` AND `the declaration states the grounds for that opinion`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must sign a declaration stating — (a) that, in the director’s opinion, the conditions specified in section 215J(1)(a) and (b) are satisfied; and (b) the grounds for that opinion" (a duty not met; the provision's own question)

-- (7): "Any director who contravenes subsection (6) shall be guilty of an offence." No penalty is stated here (fork F-215C-2).
-- src:21357 | (7) Any director who contravenes subsection (6) shall be guilty of
-- src:21358 | an offence.
@ref s 215D(7) (src:21357-21358)
GIVEN `the director contravenes subsection (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 215D(7) the director is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `the director contravenes subsection (6)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the subsection's own question; split site (i), fork F-215C-2): "Any director who contravenes subsection (6) shall be guilty of an offence" -- an element is unmet, so this subsection makes the director guilty of nothing on these facts

-- (8): "A cancellation of shares under this section is not deemed to be a reduction of share capital within the meaning of this Act." A flat negative.
-- src:21360 | (8) A cancellation of shares under this section is not deemed to be a
